      "id": "claim_911927ae79a84c20bc5a9f69895d7642",
      "statement": "SimpleSegmenter and SimpleAnswerSegmenter are the default segmenters; they live in `src/cite_right/text/segmenter_simple.py` and `src/cite_right/text/answer_segmenter.py` and have no extra dependencies.",
