      "statement": "SpacySegmenter additionally splits sentences at coordinating conjunctions (and, or, but) whose head is a VERB, AUX, or ADJ and that sit strictly inside the sentence, so lists like \"Apples, oranges, and pears are tasty.\" stay as one segment.",
