      "id": "claim_fd16f214eddf493ba0c8e37782cbc0ae",
      "statement": "PySBDSegmenter is a rule-based sentence segmenter built on pySBD; it requires the `pysbd` extra, accepts language (default \"en\") and clean (default False, preserves original text offsets), and wraps segmentation in an lru_cache(maxsize=2000). It is source-side only and is not used as an answer segmenter.",
